	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Accepi tuas, colendissime domine et compater, per hunc <persName>Fietzium</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nostrum, et arbitror te quoque interea meas, quas nuper <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>per <persName>Aloysium Muraltum</persName> scripsi, accepisse.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nihil istis nunc addere <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>possum; neque enim quicquam novi, quod certum sit, hic habemus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Constat pacem esse promulgatam, delirant reges, plecti Achivos.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/><placeName>Condensis</placeName> arma posuit; <placeName ref="l822">Germani</placeName> sunt, ut audio, dimissi <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>et in <placeName ref="l822">Germaniam</placeName> regressi.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Rex aliquas copias secum ad sui <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>custodiam retinet.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Pax non ubique pari modo accipitur; ubi <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>papistae rerum potiuntur, nolunt evangelicos recipere amplius; <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ecclesiae coartantur in angulos paucos.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quidam non in<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>doctus homo nuper ex <placeName ref="l1805">Narbonensi</placeName> <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> veniens mihi <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>retulit, quod illic papistae dominentur ubique; solas duas <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>illas civitates <placeName ref="l358">Nemausum</placeName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><placeName ref="l358">Nîmes</placeName>.</note> et <lb xml:id="p1z15"/><placeName ref="l328">Montem Pessulum</placeName> nondum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>voluisse regia suscipere praesidia, propterea quod fortiora sint <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>illa, quam ipsis promissum sit; Valentiam praesidium accepisse, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>manere tamen ibi ecclesiam, sed in angulum retrusam; <lb xml:id="p1z19"/><placeName>Auranię</placeName> etiam et apud S. Spiritum esse adhuc ecclesias, <placeName ref="l1871">Gra<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>tianopoli</placeName> omnia esse eversa; <placeName ref="l301">Lugdunenses</placeName> saevire adhuc et <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nullam velle servare pacem.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">De reliqua <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> nihil <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>referre potuit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Video vix retineri illud, quod priore <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>edicto obtentum est.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Italos aliquos sibi servavit rex; reliqui <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>(hoc certo constat) in <placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName> sunt reversi.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Audimus <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>hic de novis quibusdam motibus in <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName>, et quod urbes <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>quędam a pontifice defecerint.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Si quid sit certi, communica <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>nobis.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l808">Belgico</placeName> nihil habemus praeter ea, de quibus tu <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>quoque scribis.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Apud nos tranquilla sunt omnia, nisi quod in<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>faustum illud anabaptistarum genus in multis locis huius <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>ditionis de novo se effert, ita ut quotidie fere nobis <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>cum illis negotium sit.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Denen groben puren ist vil zwol; brist <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>inen nüt, denn das si gar hein herrschafft und oberkeit hettind, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>so wärind si herren.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName> ad duos iam fere menses aegrotat; <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>metuo, ne labores eum conficiant.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Mater mea his diebus <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>ad <placeName>Thermas</placeName> <placeName ref="l1898">Badenses</placeName> profecta est; postquam ibi laverit, ad vos <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>itura; quam tibi commendo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te nostri omnes, praesertim <lb xml:id="p1z37"/><persName ref="p7449">Diesbachius</persName>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Reliquorum pauci sunt in urbe.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem precor <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>tuis omnibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 11. iunii 1568.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">I<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>[ohannes] Hallerus</persName>, semp<lb xml:id="p1z41"/>er tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo doctissimoque <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ecclesiae antistiti fi<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>delissimo, domino meo ho<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>norando et compatri <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>charissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>M. <persName ref="p495">Heinrych <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>Bullinger</persName>n zuͦ <lb xml:id="p2z10"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
